  "id": "hypo",
  "term": "hypo-",
  "definition": "Hypo- is a prefix meaning under or below normal. In psychological compounds, it indicates a reduced degree of a function or condition, such as deficient will, lowered reaction, a mild form of mania, or reduced smell; it can also be used in anatomical or chemical terms.",
